  NodeID: CannotEscape
  SpeakerName: Narrator
  DialogueText: '"You attempt to run. You hear the dragon moving behind you. You
    feel wind pressure building up behind you as the dragon pursues you. You see
    the entrance to the lair up ahead, but suddenly you feel pain. You realize you
    don''t feel your body anymore, your vision goes black as your head hits the ground."'
  Choices:
  - ChoiceText: '[The cycle repeats.]'
